                                "sense_id": "74915164-6258-304e-a548-8bab9eedad13",
                                "text": "But then there was the rain. And with it memories of Vanikarri and the iron huts of the wards and the black-cloaked sisters running henlike through the puddles and giggling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e2738d4-25a2-4b3e-b8d8-f19e972141fe",
                                "sense_id": "74915164-6258-304e-a548-8bab9eedad13",
                                "text": "This brought other States running henlike to the winner."
